\pard\plain \ltrch\loch {\f0\fs24 For }{\f0\fs24\b1 fission}{\f0\fs24  of uranium-235, the predominant }{\f0\fs24\b1 radioactive fission products}{\f0\fs24  include isotopes of iodine, caesium, strontium, xenon and barium. ... Many of the }{\f0\fs24\b1 fission products}{\f0\fs24  decay through very short-lived isotopes to form stable isotopes, but a considerable number of the radioisotopes have half-lives longer than a day.}}